   }
  },
  "-1174695962": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -785644101,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You got it. So, what brings you here today?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-2122124801": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -785644101,
   "children": [
    -1026825013
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Shouldn't you be looking for a job?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "628640087": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -785644101,
   "children": [
    149061131
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Always good to see you, {D}.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1960700795": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Thought I’d check out the place and see how you’re doing. Plus, I’ve wanted to see who you are working with.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1180389235": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Amelia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Hello! I can see where {PC} got  his good looks from.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1523404276": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Oh, come on! You're being far too friendly.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "376544255": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Mmm, this cappucino is fantastic. You’ve got a real knack for this. Keep it up, {PC}.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1026825013": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -2122124801,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Give your old man a break. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "149061131": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 628640087,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Likewise, though it is kinda strange seeing you all like this.. Working... Being an adult...",
